{"role":"assistant","content":"The logs show three independent defects: the browser navigation drops the SPA’s auth header, the scope list names each writable area twice, and the backend invents a one-hour expiry for tokens that do not expire. I’m correcting those and adding reconnect handling for actual revocation.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_Jeq1h5YQOgoWzgU9gBeaDfzo","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Inspect OAuth code and failure logs\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Fix connection and token lifecycle defects\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Run end-to-end local verification\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Document causes and applied guidance in ANSWER.md\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}}]}
